From 9e06b3c2ce0427eaaa29b9550ddedf8793041530 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:03:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: keep secret-service on keyring's release and limit
 windows to Windows

keyring-store downcasts keyring's errors to secret_service::Error, so it must use the secret-service release keyring
3.6 uses. windows 0.62's windows-future does not compile for other targets, and the sandbox uses windows only on
Windows.
---
 codex-rs/Cargo.lock                    | 127 ++-----------------------
 codex-rs/keyring-store/Cargo.toml      |   2 +-
 codex-rs/windows-sandbox-rs/Cargo.toml |  14 +--
 3 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 126 deletions(-)

